OL,3,GNEWSAFive Gladiators will not return   
OL,4,Afor new BBC series                     
OL,6,FFive Gladiators stars will not be      
OL,7,Freturning to the BBC television show   
OL,8,Ffor its upcoming series, it is         
OL,9,Funderstood.                            
OL,11,FAthena, Comet, Bionic, Phantom and     
OL,12,FCyclone will not be featured when the  
OL,13,Fshow returns in 2027.                  
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the production said 
OL,16,Fthe departing cast members "remain part
OL,17,Fof the wider Gladiators family" and are
OL,18,Ftaking part in the ongoing arena tour, 
OL,19,Fwhich comes to an end in December.     
